    {
      "id": 433,
      "subject": "What causes you stress?",
      "replysubject": "What causes you stress?",
      "label": "What causes you stress? by Jeffrey Sanders",
      "message": "<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\">In a teaching and learning environment what causes you stress? I'll start:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:left;\"></p><ul><li>Lack of punctuality by other people. \"If you're not ten minutes early, you're late!\" as my grandma used to say.</li><li>Not being organised - which is why I tend to be over-organised, which is something I need to work on.</li></ul>",
      "messageformat": 1,
